 "raw_text": "9/29/26, 9:42 AM\n\nDate          1.1.            2.1.            Bus            4.1.\nMR result                0                         50                        100                        40\nActual\n: Eohniated         (a)                     (\u20ac)                      (e)                      (a)\nV1 = 40 (0 40)\n\nV2 =100 (0 100)\nV2 >V1 => Assessing required\n\nFunction module ISU EVENT ASSESSING checks whether assessing is required. Once the workflow has been triggered, the\ncorresponding billing documents are reversed and the relevant meter reading results are reestimated in function module\n\nISU ACTION ASSESSING.\n\nYou can use enhancement EDMASSES to implement customer-specific checks for the determination of assessing cases.\n\nee Example\n\nExample 1 - Assessing: Estimated Meter Reading Leads to Overflow\n\nDate          1.1.            2.1.            Bus\n\nMR result              995                         50                         998\n\n(a) Actual\n\n(e) Estimated           (a)                         (e)                          (a)\nV2 (55) > V1(3)\n\n=> Assessing required\n",
